"""
Motif-based trigger search script.

Instead of gradient-based optimization, this script searches for backdoor triggers
by exhaustively evaluating n-grams derived from motifs found via leakage analysis.

Strategy:
1. Load motif_analysis_summary.json generated by motif_extraction.py
2. Extract motifs from the selected cluster
3. Tokenize each motif and generate all n-grams of sizes {2, 5, 10}
4. Evaluate each n-gram candidate using combined loss (attention + entropy + divergence)
5. Select top Q candidates by loss and evaluate ASR on evaluation prompts
6. Save results with candidate triggers, their ASR, and generated responses
"""

